                                                "sense_id": "635701b2-b17d-3a32-beb9-d890e6f1cc6d",
                                                "text": "Other Adamsian enthusiasms included: fast cars; restaurants; Bach, the Beatles, Pink Floyd and Dire Straits; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
